%% Title: Orca Phase 1 Processing Flow
%% Scope: Accepted intended processing and recovery order; implementation is partial.
flowchart TD
    Event[PreCompact, SessionEnd, or explicit save]
    Handoff[Bounded deterministic handoff]
    Queue[Queue work and trigger one-shot worker]
    Pending{Publication intent exists?}
    Recover{Recorded identities and hashes match?}
    Complete[Complete or verify the fixed publication plan]
    Repair[Stop and expose content-free repair item]
    Source[Read agent source or secure retry spool]
    Normalize[Identify, filter, redact, normalize, and hash]
    Dedupe{Successful source already in Run Manifests?}
    Skip[Skip semantic work or repair checkpoint]
    Bound[Build bounded chronological provider input]
    Propose[Semantic provider proposes controlled output]
    Validate{Deterministic validation passes?}
    Retry[Publish nothing; leave checkpoint unchanged]
    Prepare[Prepare fixed outputs, Manifest, and checkpoint]
    Intent[Publish private local publication intent]
    Publish[Publish validated derived artifacts]
    Manifest[Publish durable Run Manifest]
    Checkpoint[Advance checkpoint last]
    Cleanup[Remove publication intent and staged files]
    Reconcile[Reconcile disposable retrieval projections]
    Available[Available to later explicit recall]

    Event --> Handoff --> Queue --> Pending
    Pending -->|yes| Recover
    Recover -->|no| Repair
    Recover -->|yes| Complete --> Checkpoint
    Pending -->|no| Source --> Normalize --> Dedupe
    Dedupe -->|yes| Skip --> Checkpoint
    Dedupe -->|no| Bound --> Propose --> Validate
    Validate -->|no| Retry
    Validate -->|yes| Prepare --> Intent --> Publish --> Manifest --> Checkpoint
    Checkpoint --> Cleanup --> Reconcile --> Available
